Some applications may incorporate third-party software libraries, fonts, audio recordings, images, or other materials.

Such materials remain subject to their respective copyright and licensing conditions.

This licence does not override or replace third-party licences. Where required, applicable third-party notices and licence terms will be provided separately in the THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES file accompanying the application.

