The Owner may provide updates, improvements, corrections, or additional features at the Owner's discretion.

Unless expressly stated in the purchase agreement, purchasing a licence does not guarantee perpetual updates, technical support, or access to future products.

The Owner reserves the right to discontinue or modify products, subject to applicable consumer protection laws and specific commitments made to purchasers.

8. Termination

This licence may be terminated if the purchaser materially violates its terms.

Upon termination, the purchaser must stop using the software and delete locally stored copies, except where retention is required by applicable law.

Termination does not affect rights or obligations that arose before termination.

